{
  "id": "showcase",
  "name": "Showcase: three weeks of mission",
  "description": "A film-like run for presentations: 21 mission days after a 28-day warm-up, with four scripted events separated by normal days (cabin heat for the whole crew, one person's fever, CO2 above the limit with sleep loss in 2 crew, shared sleep loss with a nominal cabin). The injected effects are 5 SD, deliberately larger than the 2-6 SD of the evaluation scenarios so they are easy to see: this scenario is for demonstration and is NOT part of the engine evaluation.",
